# PadelGalaxio Clubs App

Web admin portal for padel **club owners** (not players/coaches).

- Shares Supabase with the Expo app `players-coachs-app`
- Club owner = `clubs.owner_user_id = auth.uid()`
- Allowed roles: `roles.role` in (`club`, `admin`)
- MVP scope: club settings, courts CRUD, read-only schedule
- Out of scope unless asked: payments, multi-club SaaS, mobile UI parity

Prefer small focused diffs. Match existing PadelGalaxio naming and data shapes.
